```

---

## Usage

1. Launch the program
2. Click "Open Image"
3. Select an image file
4. The image will automatically scale to fit the window

Resizing the window will dynamically adjust the image size.

---

## Future Improvements

* Smooth zoom (scroll wheel support)
* Click-and-drag panning
* Image centering within the window
* GPU acceleration
* Efficient handling of massive images (tiling/streaming)

